                                   1008 ; ---------------------------------------------------------------- seed
                                   1009 ; P1 endpoint seed: first-rise / last-fall brackets pin K and tau.
                                   1010 ; np reuses r_melo, flm r_mehi, r0m r_de (refine scratch, disjoint use).
